DTSTAMP:20260709T124150Z
DTSTART:20260908T120000Z
DTEND:20260910T180000Z
SUMMARY:Saudi Wood Expo
DESCRIPTION:The Saudi Wood Expo is the Kingdom’s leading exhibition for the wood and woodworking sector\, bringing together suppliers\, buyers\, and specifiers to discover the latest industry trends\, sustainable wood products\, and innovative design solutions. Exhibitors and visitors can connect directly with decision-makers\, explore new product launches\, and build partnerships aligned with the growing demand driven by Saudi Arabia’s Vision 2030 projects. The event is co-located with the Saudi Industrial Series\, creating a wider platform for cross-sector networking and business opportunities.
LOCATION:Riyadh International Convention and Exhibition Center
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-saudi-wood-expo.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-saudi-industrial-series@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260709T124150Z
DTSTART:20260908T120000Z
DTEND:20260910T180000Z
SUMMARY:Saudi Industrial Series
DESCRIPTION:Running from 8 to 10 September 2026 at the Riyadh International Convention & Exhibition Center (RICEC) from 3:00 PM to 9:00 PM\, this dedicated industry event returns for its second edition as a platform focused on Saudi Arabia’s industrial expansion. Co-located with Saudi Wood Expo\, it brings together thousands of professionals\, industry leaders\, and decision-makers to explore solutions\, suppliers\, and partnerships that support growth across key industrial sectors.
LOCATION:Riyadh International Convention & Exhibition Center
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-saudi-industrial-series.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-smart-cities-saudi-expo@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260709T124150Z
DTSTART:20260915T110000Z
DTEND:20260917T190000Z
SUMMARY:Smart Cities Saudi Expo
DESCRIPTION:The Smart Cities Saudi Expo takes place in Riyadh from 15–17 September 2026 at the Riyadh International Convention & Exhibition Center\, showcasing innovative technologies and solutions that support smarter\, more connected communities across the Kingdom. Co-located with the Global Infrastructure Expo\, the event brings together the full ecosystem of smart city technologies\, urban planning\, and digital infrastructure—offering visitors and industry professionals a prime opportunity to explore leading suppliers for smart city projects\, gain the latest insights\, and network with peers and decision-makers shaping the future of cognitive urban living in Saudi Arabia. Inquire Now
LOCATION:Riyadh International Convention & Exhibition Center
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-smart-cities-saudi-expo.html
END:VEVENT
